Third-party files
-----------------

infrastructure/unikraft/postgres/
  Copied from the Unikraft Cloud examples repository:
  https://github.com/unikraft-cloud/examples/tree/main/postgres
  The upstream repository does not state a license; these files are not
  covered by this repository's LICENSE. Local changes: Kraftfile name and
  max_wal_size; in the Dockerfile, base images pinned by digest, downloads
  checked by SHA-256, the extension pinned to a commit, the version set once
  (ARG PG_VERSION), and the runtime libraries collected with ldd instead of
  listed by name.

infrastructure/unikraft/postgres/wrapper.sh
  Derived from the docker-library/postgres entrypoint script:
